This codebase contains **Xfinalw3**, a modern Web3 development framework for building dApps on Ethereum. Primary frontend is SolidStart + `@wagmi/solid`; Foundry, bponder indexer, and Bun jobs complete the stack.

It's a Bun monorepo that contains following packages:

- FOUNDRY (`packages/foundry`): Solidity write / test / deploy.
- Solid (`packages/solid` / `@w3s/solid`): **Xfinalw3** dApp — SolidStart + `@wagmi/solid`. User shell `routes/(app)`; admin shell `/mng` (AdminGuard + cookie auth). Prefer patterns extracted from production MMM Solid — not Svelte stores.
- Indexer (`packages/indexer`): Bun-native [bponder](https://github.com/chy3xyz/bponder); Hono API includes `adminAuth`, GraphQL guard, and gated public `POST /rpc` proxy (method deny-list + weighted rate limit; upstream key server-side only).
- Job (`packages/job` / `@w3s/cron`): Bun keepers; reuse `src/lib/rpc.ts` + `src/lib/gql.ts` (from mmm job/lib).
- Landing (`packages/landing`): Static framework site (`bun landing`).


The usual dev flow is:

- Start Xfinalw3 locally:
  - `bun chain`: Starts a local blockchain network
  - `bun deploy:local`: Deploys default contracts (Counter example)
  - `bun start`: Starts the Solid dApp (`@w3s/solid`)
  - `bun indexer`: Starts the indexer
  - `bun cron` / job package: Starts background jobs
- Write a Smart Contract (modify the deployment script in `packages/foundry/script` if needed)
- Deploy it locally (`bun deploy:local`)
- Go to `http://localhost:5173/debug` to inspect deployed contracts
- Iterate until you get the functionality you want in your contract
- Write tests for the contract in `packages/foundry/test`
- Build UI with Solid components under `packages/solid/src/components` and scaffold hooks under `packages/solid/src/lib/scaffold`
- Deploy your Smart Contract to a live network
- Build / run:
  - `bun run build`
  - `bun start:prod`
  - Network / WC: `packages/solid/scaffold.config.ts`
- Do not treat Node/pnpm as prerequisites; package manager and runtime for the monorepo are Bun only.
- Disk: root `bunfig.toml` uses hoisted `node_modules`; shared deps via `workspaces.catalog` (`viem`, `hono`, `typescript`, …). Prefer `catalog:` in package.json. Indexer uses npm `bponder` (default no vendor). See `docs/BUN_DISK.md` / `bun run slim:disk`.
- CI covers Solid check/build + Foundry + indexer/job tests (not SvelteKit). Indexer sample: local Counter `CountUpdated` + Heartbeat. Prod security: GraphQL API key required; RPC deny unknown methods (see `runtimeEnv.ts`). Local recipe: `bun stack`.
- Solid scaffold hooks: `useScaffoldReadContract` / `Write` / `Contract` / `EventHistory`. Multi-chain via `VITE_TARGET_CHAINS` + `VITE_RPC_URL_<id>`. Admin sample: `/mng/counts`.

## Smart Contract UI interactions guidelines (Solid / @wagmi/solid)
Xfinalw3 Solid reads ABIs/addresses from `packages/solid/src/lib/contracts` (`deployedContracts.ts` + `externalContracts.ts`).

### Reading
```typescript
import { useScaffoldReadContract } from "~/lib/scaffold"

const read = useScaffoldReadContract<bigint>({
  contractName: "YourContract",
  functionName: "functionName",
  args: [arg1, arg2],
  watch: true,
})
// read.data() / read.isLoading() / read.error()
```

### Writing
```typescript
import { useScaffoldWriteContract } from "~/lib/scaffold"
import { parseEther } from "viem"

const write = useScaffoldWriteContract({ contractName: "YourContract" })
await write.writeContractAsync({
  functionName: "functionName",
  args: [arg1, arg2],
  value: parseEther("0.1"),
})
// write.isMining()
```

Prefer these scaffold hooks (and `~/lib/web3/wallet` helpers) over ad-hoc viem clients for app contract calls.

## Display / UI wheels (Solid)
Reusable pieces under `packages/solid/src/components`:

- `ui/*` — Button, Card, Modal, Spinner, Skeleton, NotifyContainer, …
- `site/*` — SiteHeader, BottomNav, ChainBanner, SplashGate, WalletSync, AnnouncementTicker
- `shared/ConnectGate` — connect-wallet gate card
- `admin/*` — AdminGuard, Sidebar, AdminHeader, Pager, AdminCard, AdminRoleNotice, AdminMobileList, AdminWallet

Admin REST: `~/lib/api` → `/api/admin/auth/*` (Vite proxies `/api` to indexer). Roles: viewer ⊂ operator ⊂ owner.

Indexer GraphQL: `~/lib/indexer/client` (`indexerGraphql`).

Wallet helpers: `packages/solid/src/lib/web3`.

## Theme and Layout

- User shell (`routes/(app).tsx`): dark theme, Header + BottomNav (Home / Trade / Swap / Me)
- User routes: `/` poster+entries, `/trade`, `/swap`, `/me`, `/assets`, `/team`, `/faq`, `/debug`
- Content config: `lib/config/appContent.ts` (announcements, feature grid, FAQ)
- Admin shell (`routes/mng.tsx`): light/dark toggle, Sidebar from `uiStore.menuGroups`, ⌘K menu search
- `/mng` requires indexer admin auth (`ADMIN_PASSWORD_SHA256`)

